CorvCAD patch series for KiCad 10.0.6 (caf7377), on top of 0005: keep the board model free of
editor dialogs and widgets.

Applied by integrations/kicad_core/fetch.py. The desktop editor keeps working: each function
moves next to the dialogs that call it, unchanged.

1. PCB_TEXT::ShowSyntaxHelp() moves from pcb_text.cpp to dialogs/dialog_text_properties.cpp
   (as patch 0001 did for SCH_TEXT). It pulled HTML_MESSAGE_BOX, DIALOG_SHIM, KIWAY's blocking
   dialog and the local-history restore dialog into every board load.
2. ZONE_SETTINGS::SetupLayersList() and LAYER_PROPERTIES_GRID_TABLE move from zone_settings.cpp
   to a new zone_layer_properties_grid.cpp (listed in pcbnew/CMakeLists.txt). They pulled the
   color swatch, WX_GRID and KIUI helpers in through BOARD_DESIGN_SETTINGS.
